{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-05-04 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT JOINS TSMC OPEN INNOVATION PLATFORM 3DFABRIC ALLIANCE', 'text': "SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #3DFABRIC--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS) HAS JOINED THE TSMC OPEN INNOVATION PLATFORM® (OIP) 3DFABRIC ALLIANCE, WHICH WAS FORMED RECENTLY BY TSMC TO ACCELERATE 3D INTEGRATED CIRCUIT (IC) ECOSYSTEM INNOVATION AND READINESS. THE ALLIANCE FOCUSES ON ACHIEVING RAPID IMPLEMENTATION OF SILICON AND SYSTEM-LEVEL INNOVATIONS THAT ENABLE NEXT-GENERATION COMPUTE AND MOBILE APPLICATIONS USING TSMC'S 3DFABRIC™ TECHNOLOGIES. 3DFABRIC ALLIANCE MEMBERSHIP GIVES KEYSIGHT ACC."}